    "text": "Eithne, daughter of the Fomorian king Balor, became mother of the hero Lugh. Balor of the Evil Eye learned a prophecy that her child would kill him. He shut her in a tower on Tory Island, off Ireland's northwest coast. The man Cian, disguised as a woman with the druid Biróg's aid, entered and begot triplets, including Lugh. Balor threw the children into the sea. Lugh survived and slew his grandfather at the second battle of Mag Tuired.",
